# Demo TLS keys and certificates are generated locally (see openssl/README.md).
# Never commit them: a published CA key lets anyone mint certificates that every
# machine trusting that CA will accept.
openssl/*
!openssl/README.md
!openssl/demo.cnf
!openssl/v3.ext
*.key
*.pem
*.crt
*.csr
*.srl
*.p12
*.pfx
